    <h2>What we do not log</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Copy edits that do not change meaning.</li>
      <li>Formatting changes.</li>
      <li>Updates to internal links.</li>
      <li>Changes to the last-reviewed date when nothing substantive changed.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>A note on ranges</h2>
    <p>Most cost and transit figures here are ranges, not point estimates. A range is not a correction target unless it is clearly wrong or unsupported; if it goes stale, the page is updated and the new conditions noted.</p>

